ng game. Would just like to play with more than one friend", "timestamp_created": 1699394283, "timestamp_updated": 1699394283, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.508821606636047363", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "149727147", "author": {"steamid": "76561198042492558", "personaname": "GrilledCheese042", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198042492558/", "num_games_owned": 492, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 2165, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 809, "last_played": 1705292548, "avatar": "85dae2a7c84e97771e072769435780e90f70c7b5"}, "language": "english", "review": "a comic style looter shooter with rogue like elements and a kick ass soundtrack. Whats not to love?", "timestamp_created": 1699393097, "timestamp_updated": 1699393097, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "149726388", "author": {"steamid": "76561198327020526", "personaname": "Liekend", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198327020526/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 48, "playtime_forever": 3403, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1333, "last_played": 1747794758, "avatar": "aaad16847f956f66a1dc362af2670336ede30387"}, "language": "english", "review": "I have played this game on and off of early access and coming back to it was always a joy. After playing the 1.0 version I can say without a doubt that if you like movement shooters, you will probably like this game. While hard when you first start out, but once you start to vibe with it, this game is just crazy fun!", "timestamp_created": 1699392050, "timestamp_updated": 1699392050, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "149726377", "author": {"steamid": "76561197965521837", "personaname": "TRUCK MONTH", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197965521837/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 65, "playtime_forever": 5689, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5228, "last_played": 1700437916, "avatar": "8f1ad890436c945153989a69031f852e44f40264"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fantastic game. I've been playing it for a couple years during it's early access period and they have steadily reworked the game for the better during that time. Upgrades as you level are considerably stronger than before, and they did away with gameplay mechanics that pigeonholed you into having fewer options as you progressed in the game.\n\nIt's a fast FPS rogue like with the usual incentives to keep going for more upgrades and more choices and levels to unlock as you progress. Gameplay speed is similar to Titanfall or Doom Eternal, with the game made up of multiple arenas and bosses. \nSoundtrack is phenomenal, Noisecream crushed it again.\n\nHighly recommended, especially with 2 player co-op.", "timestamp_created": 1699392038, "timestamp_updated": 1699392038, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "149726057", "author": {"steamid": "76561198366286888", "personaname": "Volker Racho", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/LUNARES_/", "num_games_owned": 137, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 8865, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1016, "playtime_at_review": 2124, "last_played": 1789843765, "avatar": "355ab0c49253636b096eeb200238f714879b36e9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Not the first ever FPS Roguelite but the first that did it right.", "timestamp_created": 1699391611, "timestamp_updated": 1699391611, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "149725448", "author": {"steamid": "76561198048288016", "personaname": "Mayor Bang Town", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/HEAVYMETALPIRATE/", "num_games_owned": 345, "num_reviews": 79, "playtime_forever": 3445, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2639, "last_played": 1739746348, "avatar": "601cb0ef216bd813ceed20f7c7468b4d4378caaa"}, "language": "english", "review": "The Alpha was dope, but starbreeze got their grubby little hands in there and ruined the game. aside from funny starbreeze joke. they removed the wrenches from completing levels, made the game seemingly more grindy and kinda s h i t. I would recommend playing with friends but playing solo now almost has no fun for me anymore. especially how they restarted everyones progress without a good way to get wrenches easily like in the alpha. F U C K  Y O U S T AR BREEZE", "timestamp_created": 1699390725, "timestamp_updated": 1699390725, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.479620009660720825", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": fals